3! = 6
factorial(4) = 24
(-7) % 3 = 2
quot(17, 5) = 3
gcd(54, (-24)) = 6
lcm(12, (-18)) = 36
sqrt(4) = 2
sqrt(0.36) = 0.6
log(2, 8) = 3
log(10, 100) = 2

have a N = 3!
